{"title":"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Show that the bisect of an angle in a triangle divides the opposite side in segments whose\nlengths have the same ratio as the ratio of the adjacent sides,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc4046d24edd6833365b1eefa3a0fc2836a4ed97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AN/NB = CA/CB\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\nin the picture below. NOTE: The same is true for the bisector of an exterior angle of a\ntriangle, i.e., it divides the opposite side externally into segments that are proportional\nto the adjacent sides. You do not have to write a proof of this fact.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2015 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_Hi